     in the Software;

  c) use the Software to provide paid flight instruction, paid simulator sessions
     or any other service sold to third parties, without the Author's prior
     written permission. Using it in the course of your own work, or showing it to
     others, is not such a service.

Nothing in this section restricts rights you hold under applicable mandatory law,
including any right to decompile the Software for interoperability purposes where
that right exists and cannot be waived by contract.

