6. NOT AN AVIATION TRAINING DEVICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software is entertainment software for a desktop flight simulator. It is not
a certified or approved aviation training device of any kind, and it is not a
substitute for instruction by a qualified flight instructor.

You may of course use the Software however you find it useful, including
alongside real flight training — that is not something this agreement tries to
forbid, and could not be enforced if it did. But you do so entirely at your own
risk: the Author makes no representation that anything practised with the
Software produces any skill applicable to an actual aircraft, and accepts no
responsibility for any use of it in connection with real-world flying.

